\engtitle{.. Shri SubrahmaNyAShTakam or shrIsubrahmaNya karAvalambastotram ..}##
\itxtitle{.. shrIsubrahmaNyAShTakam athavA shrIsubrahmaNya karAvalambastotram ..}##\endtitles ##
he svAminAtha\! karuNAkara dInabandho
    shrIpArvatIshamukhapa~Nkajapadmabandho |
shrIshAdidevagaNapUjitapAdapadma
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 1||
devAdhidevasuta devagaNAdhinAtha
    devendravandyamR^idupa~Nkajama~njupAda |
devarShinAradamunIndrasugItakIrte
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 2||
nityAnnadAnaniratAkhilarogahArin
    bhAgyapradAnaparipUritabhaktakAma |
shR^ityAgamapraNavavAchyanijasvarUpa
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 3||
krau~nchAsurendraparikhaNDana shaktishUla\-
    chApAdishastraparimaNDitadivyapANe | ## var ## pAshAdishastra
shrIkuNDalIshadharatuNDashikhIndravAha ## var##  dhR^itatuNDa
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 4||
devAdhidevarathamaNDalamadhyave.adya
    devendrapIThanakaraM dR^iDhachApahastam |
shUraM nihatya surakoTibhirIDyamAna
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 5||
hArAdiratnamaNiyuktakirITahAra
    keyUrakuNDalalasatkavachAbhirAmam |
he vIra tArakajayAmaravR^indavandya
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 6||
pa~nchAkSharAdimanumantritagA~NgatoyaiH
    pa~nchAmR^itaiH pramuditendramukhairmunIndraiH |
paTTAbhiShiktahariyukta parAsanAtha
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 7||
shrIkArtikeya karuNAmR^itapUrNadR^iShTyA
    kAmAdirogakaluShIkR^itaduShTachittam |
siktvA tu mAmava kalAdharakAntikAntyA
    vallIshanAtha mama dehi karAvalambam || 8||
subrahmaNyAShTakaM puNyaM ye paThanti dvijottamAH |
te sarve muktimAyAnti subrahmaNyaprasAdataH ||
subrahmaNyAShTakamidaM prAtarutthAya yaH paThet |
koTijanmakR^itaM pApaM tatkShaNAdeva nashyati ||

|| iti shrIsubrahmaNyAShTakaM athavA
shrIsubrahmaNya karAvalambastotraM sampUrNam ||
##
vallIsha is same as vallIsa as found in some prints.
granthanidhi
